      "options": {
        "content": "### Executive Overview\nStart here for the fastest answers. Use the summary stats to decide whether you need **API Investigation**, **Tool Investigation**, **Prompt Investigation**, or **Session Explorer**. The canary row highlights regression-style signals before you drill into the tables below.",
